### Update Profile Endpoints Examples
### Base URL: http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/me (via API Gateway)
### Authentication: Bearer token required

@baseUrl = http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/me
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### ============================================
### 1. UPDATE PROFILE (JSON ONLY)
### ============================================

### Update Basic Information
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "username": "johndoe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

### Update Social Media Links
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "telegramId": "@johndoe",
  "instagram": "johndoe_official",
  "websites": "https://johndoe.com,https://blog.johndoe.com"
}

### Update Location and Bio
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "country": "United States",
  "city": "New York",
  "about": "Software developer passionate about blockchain technology and decentralized applications."
}

### Update Only Username
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "username": "newusername"
}

### Update Multiple Fields
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "username": "janesmith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "telegramId": "@janesmith",
  "instagram": "janesmith_official",
  "country": "Canada",
  "city": "Toronto",
  "about": "Full-stack developer and crypto enthusiast.",
  "websites": "https://janesmith.dev"
}

### Update Only Instagram Field
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "instagram": "johndoe_official"
}

### ============================================
### 2. UPDATE PROFILE WITH IMAGE (MULTIPART)
### ============================================

### Update Profile with Image Only
### Note: Send empty JSON object '{}' if no profile data to update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"

{}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/profile.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Update Profile Data with Image
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"

{"firstName":"John","lastName":"Doe","username":"johndoe","instagram":"johndoe_official"}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/profile.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Update Profile Data Only (Multipart - No Image)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"

{"firstName":"Jane","lastName":"Smith","email":"jane.smith@example.com","instagram":"janesmith_official"}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Update Profile with Multiple Fields and Image
PATCH {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"

{"firstName":"John","lastName":"Doe","username":"johndoe","email":"john.doe@example.com","telegramId":"@johndoe","instagram":"johndoe_official","country":"United States","city":"New York","about":"Software developer passionate about blockchain technology.","websites":"https://johndoe.com"}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/profile.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### ============================================
### NOTES:
### ============================================
### 1. For JSON endpoint: Use Content-Type: application/json
### 2. For Multipart endpoint: Use Content-Type: multipart/form-data
### 3. All fields are optional (partial update supported)
### 4. For multipart with image only: send data='{}' (empty JSON object)
### 5. Image formats: JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP (max 5MB)
### 6. Images are auto-resized to max 1024x1024 and converted to JPEG
### 7. Username must be unique if provided
### 8. Email must be valid format if provided

